<title>UK: OZ Holding sets Stillhalter Vision warrants.</title>
<headline>OZ Holding sets Stillhalter Vision warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>OZ Holding, Zurich said it has issued one million European-style put warrants on Stillhalter Vision bearer shares.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    560 CHF		   ISSUE PRICE  11 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	17.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	20.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  575 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
